WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.107
CocoaPods goes read-only

00:00:01.918 --> 00:00:03.133
on December 2

00:00:03.654 --> 00:00:05.175
The CocoaPods registry

00:00:04.987 --> 00:00:06.248
becomes permanently

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.960
read-only from December 2, 2026

00:00:09.102 --> 00:00:10.257
so Flutter apps

00:00:10.069 --> 00:00:10.882
still using it

00:00:10.694 --> 00:00:11.460
need to move

00:00:11.272 --> 00:00:12.380
to Swift Package

00:00:12.192 --> 00:00:12.911
Manager

00:00:13.438 --> 00:00:14.982
Swift Package Manager

00:00:14.794 --> 00:00:15.761
has been enabled

00:00:15.572 --> 00:00:16.669
by default since

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.320
Flutter 3.44

00:00:18.509 --> 00:00:20.336
and version 3.50 now

00:00:20.148 --> 00:00:21.834
alerts when SwiftPM

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:22.813
has been disabled

00:00:23.342 --> 00:00:24.108
The fix is

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:24.544
to check your

00:00:24.356 --> 00:00:25.228
Flutter version

00:00:25.276 --> 00:00:26.643
re-enable SwiftPM

00:00:26.738 --> 00:00:27.127
and

00:00:27.163 --> 00:00:27.929
do a clean

00:00:27.741 --> 00:00:28.754
iOS build to

00:00:28.566 --> 00:00:29.792
find plugins still

00:00:29.604 --> 00:00:30.853
using CocoaPods

00:00:31.374 --> 00:00:32.388
Full story on

00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:33.095
the dashboard
